        <span data-lang="ko">이 사이트의 <a class="text-accent-700 dark:text-accent-400 font-medium underline underline-offset-2" href={`${base}/prompts/agents-quick-onboarding/`}>퀵 온보딩 프롬프트</a>를 복사해 에이전트에 그대로 붙여넣으면, 공용 <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">~/.agents/</code> 구조를 잡고 보유한 모든 CLI에 스킬을 심링크해 준다. OpenCode는 <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">~/.config/opencode/skills/</code>에서 스킬을 읽는다.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="mb-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-300">
        <span data-lang="en">The <a class="text-accent-700 dark:text-accent-400 font-medium underline underline-offset-2" href={`${base}/plugins/glm-vision/`}>glm-vision plugin</a> covers the blind spot from STEP 7: it sends any image to GLM-4.6V and returns the exact text/tables it reads. Two lines to install:</span>
        <span data-lang="ko">STEP 7에서 짚은 사각지대를 <a class="text-accent-700 dark:text-accent-400 font-medium underline underline-offset-2" href={`${base}/plugins/glm-vision/`}>glm-vision 플러그인</a>이 메운다. 이미지를 GLM-4.6V로 보내 글자·표를 그대로 읽어 돌려준다. 설치는 두 줄:</span>
      </p>
      <div class="mb-3 flex items-stretch gap-2">
        <code id="tip-vision-install" class="min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre rounded-lg border border-ink-800/70 bg-ink-950 px-3 py-2 font-mono text-[0.82rem] text-ink-100">{cmdVisionInstall}</code>
        <CopyButton target="#tip-vision-install" labelEn="Copy" labelKo="복사" size="sm" variant="ghost" class="shrink-0" />
      </div>
      <div class="mb-3 flex items-stretch gap-2">
        <code id="tip-vision-use" class="min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre rounded-lg border border-ink-800/70 bg-ink-950 px-3 py-2 font-mono text-[0.82rem] text-ink-100">{cmdVisionUse}</code>
        <CopyButton target="#tip-vision-use" labelEn="Copy" labelKo="복사" size="sm" variant="ghost" class="shrink-0" />
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-300">
        <span data-lang="en">End-to-end test passed against the real glm-4.6v API (2026-08-18): it read planted text <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">PROMPTBOX-7742</code> and all three shapes from a generated image. Run <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">python3 ~/promptbox/plugins/glm-vision/test/run_test.py</code> to verify your key.</span>
        <span data-lang="ko">실제 glm-4.6v API로 종단 테스트를 통과했다(2026-08-18) — 테스트 이미지에 심어둔 문구 <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">PROMPTBOX-7742</code>와 도형 3개를 정확히 읽었다. 내 키가 잘 작동하는지는 <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">python3 ~/promptbox/plugins/glm-vision/test/run_test.py</code>로 확인할 수 있다.</span>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-5 lg:p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink-900 dark:text-ink-50">
        <span data-lang="en">Why this setup?</span>
        <span data-lang="ko">왜 이 구성인가?</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-300">
        <span data-lang="en">OpenCode ships no model of its own, so one Z.ai coding-plan key is the whole cost, and you can swap providers later without changing harness. oh-my-opencode-slim turns that single agent into a team whose members can each run a different model, so the expensive lane and the cheap lane are separate line items. GLM-5.3 carries a 1,000,000-token context, which is what makes "read the whole repo first" realistic.</span>
        <span data-lang="ko">OpenCode는 자체 모델이 없어서 Z.ai 코딩 플랜 키 하나가 비용의 전부이고, 나중에 하네스를 바꾸지 않고 모델만 갈아끼울 수 있다. oh-my-opencode-slim은 그 한 명을 팀으로 만들되 구성원마다 다른 모델을 물릴 수 있어서, 비싼 자리와 싼 자리를 분리해 쓸 수 있다. GLM-5.3의 컨텍스트는 100만 토큰이라 "저장소 전체를 먼저 읽고 시작하는" 방식이 현실적으로 가능해진다.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-300">
        <a class="text-accent-700 dark:text-accent-400 font-medium underline underline-offset-2" href={`${base}/harnesses/opencode/`}>OpenCode 상세 →</a>
        <span class="mx-2 text-ink-400">·</span>
        <a class="text-accent-700 dark:text-accent-400 font-medium underline underline-offset-2" href={`${base}/harnesses/oh-my-opencode-slim/`}>oh-my-opencode-slim 상세 →</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- 대안 -->
    <section class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-5 lg:p-6">
      <details class="group">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none">
          <span class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink-900 dark:text-ink-50">
            <span data-lang="en">Alternative — Prime Agent (single-agent harness)</span>
            <span data-lang="ko">다른 선택지 — Prime Agent (에이전트 한 명짜리 하네스)</span>
          </span>
          <span class="ml-2 text-sm text-ink-500 group-open:hidden">▸</span>
          <span class="ml-2 hidden text-sm text-ink-500 group-open:inline">▾</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-300">
          <span data-lang="en">If a team of seven feels like too much machinery, <a class="text-accent-700 dark:text-accent-400 font-medium underline underline-offset-2" href={`${base}/harnesses/prime-agent/`}>Prime Agent</a> is the opposite bet: one agent whose only tool is a persistent IPython kernel, so Python variables and loaded data survive across turns. It reads the same <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">~/.agents/skills/</code> directory this site installs into, and it takes the same Z.ai key. <strong class="font-semibold text-ink-800 dark:text-ink-100">It sits best on macOS</strong> — the official one-line installer targets macOS/Linux, and Windows needs a bash shell (Git Bash or WSL) before it will run at all.</span>
          <span data-lang="ko">일곱 명짜리 팀이 과하게 느껴진다면, <a class="text-accent-700 dark:text-accent-400 font-medium underline underline-offset-2" href={`${base}/harnesses/prime-agent/`}>Prime Agent</a>는 정반대 선택이다. 도구가 영구 IPython 커널(살아 있는 파이썬 환경) 하나뿐인 단일 에이전트라, 변수와 읽어둔 데이터가 턴이 바뀌어도 남아 있다. 이 사이트가 설치하는 <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">~/.agents/skills/</code>를 그대로 읽고, Z.ai 키도 같은 것을 쓴다. <strong class="font-semibold text-ink-800 dark:text-ink-100">특히 macOS와 궁합이 좋다</strong> — 공식 한 줄 인스톨러가 macOS·Linux를 대상으로 하고, Windows는 bash 셸(Git Bash 또는 WSL)을 먼저 갖춰야 실행조차 된다.</span>
        </p>
        <div class="mt-3 flex items-stretch gap-2">
          <code id="tip-prime" class="min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre rounded-lg border border-ink-800/70 bg-ink-950 px-3 py-2 font-mono text-[0.82rem] text-ink-100">{cmdPrimeInstall}</code>
          <CopyButton target="#tip-prime" labelEn="Copy" labelKo="복사" size="sm" variant="ghost" class="shrink-0" />
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-300">
          <span data-lang="en">Needs Node.js 22.8+. Key storage is <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">~/.prime/agent/auth.json</code>; the env-var route is <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">export ZAI_API_KEY=…</code>. Unlike OpenCode it can take pasted screenshots via <kbd class="rounded border border-ink-300 px-1 font-mono text-xs dark:border-ink-700">Ctrl+V</kbd>, but only if the model you selected can read images — GLM Coding Plan models cannot.</span>
          <span data-lang="ko">Node.js 22.8 이상이 필요하다. 키는 <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">~/.prime/agent/auth.json</code>에 저장되고, 환경변수로 넣으려면 <code class="font-mono text-[0.85em]">export ZAI_API_KEY=…</code>. <kbd class="rounded border border-ink-300 px-1 font-mono text-xs dark:border-ink-700">Ctrl+V</kbd>로 스크린샷을 붙여넣는 기능이 있지만, 고른 모델이 이미지를 읽을 수 있어야 의미가 있다 — GLM Coding Plan 모델은 읽지 못한다.</span>
        </p>
      </details>
    </section>

  </div>
